Package: rfedqr
Type: Package
Title: Federated Penalized Quantile Regression with Primal-Dual Splitting
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Feiming", "Wang", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "wangfeiming@mail.nankai.edu.cn")
Author: Feiming Wang [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Feiming Wang <wangfeiming@mail.nankai.edu.cn>
Description: Implements federated algorithms for penalized quantile regression,
    including box-dual primal-dual splitting, smoothing, subgradient, consensus,
    and alternating direction baselines. The package provides simulation tools,
    client partition utilities, calibration diagnostics, and unified wrappers for
    comparing methods under client sampling and local mini-batch sampling.
